            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩwavũthiw’e, na kũlewa nĩ andũ; aĩ mũndũ wa mawoo, na mũmanyi wa thĩna: na nĩwavũthiw’e ta ũmwe ũla andũ mamũvithaa mothyũ moo; naitũ tũtyaamũtw’a ta kĩndũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        },
