            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ithyonthe ta malondu nĩtwaaĩte; nĩtweethyũũie kĩla ũmwe na kũatĩĩa nzĩa yake mwene; nake Yeova amwaĩkisye ũthũku witũ ithyonthe. ",
