              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We nĩwathĩniw’e, ĩndĩ akĩthĩnw’a ndaathamya kanyw’a wake; o ta katena ka ĩlondu katongoew’e kũthi kũthĩnzwa, na ta ĩlondu yĩ mbee wa ala mayĩtilaa maw’ĩa yĩvindĩtye, o ta ũu we ndaathamya kanyw’a wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.7"
            ]
          }
