              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũu w’onthe Yeova nĩwendeew’e nĩ kũmũuauĩkya; nĩwamũthĩnisye: o yĩla wĩtw’ĩkĩthya thayũ wake wĩthĩwe nthembo kwondũ wa naĩ, akoona ũsyao wake, akongeleela matukũ make, na ũndũ ũla wendeeasya Yeova ũkaathimĩka kw’okonĩ kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoona thĩna wa ngoo yake, nake akeanĩwa: kwondũ wa ũmanyi wake mwene ũsu mũthũkũmi wakwa mũlũngalu akatw’ĩkĩthya aingĩ methĩwe alũngalu; na akakua mothũku moo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
